**Tips:**
- Before you send it, check that 30 days have actually passed since you moved out.
- Keep a copy. It's also worth sending one by certified mail so you have proof of delivery.
- Gather your move-in and move-out condition records and photos.
- The [Nevada Supreme Court Self-Help Center](https://selfhelp.nvcourts.gov/) can help if you need to go to small claims.

